    "description": "What is DailyGift? DailyGift can help you record your habits and get amazing rewards along the way!\ud83d\udeb6\r\n\r\nSimple step-by-step guide to help you get physical health\u2764\ufe0fand living expenses\ud83d\udcb0 on DailyGift.\r\n\r\n1\ufe0f\u20e3 Download and install DailyGift\ud83d\udcf1 \r\n2\ufe0f\u20e3 Record lifestyle habits (such as drinking water, running, going to the toilet, etc.) on DailyGift\ud83d\udd34 \r\n3\ufe0f\u20e3  While finish recording, DailyGift will give you many rewards\ud83c\udf81\r\n4\ufe0f\u20e3All rewards can be redeemed for rewards such as Amazon gift cards and more!\ud83d\udd25\r\nPS: All rewards are real and obtainable, please rest assured!\ud83d\udcaf\r\n\ud83d\udd79\ufe0f What are you waiting for? Use DailyGift now!\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udd12DailyGift's pedometer statistic consumes very little and does not collect your private data! Please feel free to use it!",
